  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.itemOxidationMethod": "Item Oxidation Method",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.itemOxidationMethod.@Tooltip": "Choose how copper items oxidize:\n[None] Items never oxidize naturally.\n[Durability] Oxidation stage is determined by durability:\n • 100–75% → Unexposed\n • 75–50% → Exposed\n • 50–25% → Weathered\n • 25–0% → Oxidized\n[Time] Items oxidize gradually over their lifespan, similar to copper blocks.\n[Both] Items oxidize based on both durability and lifespan, with weighted influence.",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.maxLifespanTick": "Max Lifespan (Ticks)",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.maxLifespanTick.@Tooltip": "Defines how long an item can exist before reaching full oxidation when using time-based methods.\nFor example, 36000 ticks = 30 minutes of real time.",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.alphaWeight": "Durability Weight (α)",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.alphaWeight.@Tooltip": "Controls how strongly durability influences oxidation when using the 'Both' method.\nHigher values make damage more important in determining oxidation progression.",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.betaWeight": "Time Weight (β)",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.betaWeight.@Tooltip": "Controls how strongly lifespan influences oxidation when using the 'Both' method.\nHigher values make item age more important in determining oxidation progression.",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.oxidationIntervalAttempt": "Oxidation Check Interval (Ticks)",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.oxidation.oxidationIntervalAttempt.@Tooltip": "Defines how often the game attempts to progress oxidation.\nLower values = more frequent checks.\nFor example, 200 ticks = every 10 seconds of real time.\n⚠ Warning: Setting this too low may cause performance issues due to excessive oxidation checks.",

  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.textures.waxedUniqueTextures": "Waxed Unique Textures",
  "text.autoconfig.CopperEquipmentsConfigs.option.textures.waxedUniqueTextures.@Tooltip": "Changes block textures to show subtle honey details.",
